                <mxCell id="p2-title" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;" value="NOVAMART  |  ARQUITETURA DA APLICAÇÃO AO ANALYTICS" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="48" width="1750" x="70" y="42" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-subtitle" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#A5B4FC;fontSize=15;" value="Visão ponta a ponta • aplicação Flask • PostgreSQL • dbt • Metabase • execução agendada" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="30" width="1700" x="72" y="91" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-user" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#172554;strokeColor=#818CF8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E0E7FF;fontSize=16;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;USUÁRIO / ANALISTA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Navegador&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• App: http://IP_PUBLICO:5000&lt;br&gt;• Metabase embed: http://IP_PUBLICO:3000&lt;br&gt;• SSH administrativo: TCP 22" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="200" width="250" x="55" y="250" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-sg" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#2A1B38;strokeColor=#C084FC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#F3E8FF;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;AWS SECURITY GROUP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Entrada a considerar&lt;br&gt;• TCP 22 — SSH, só IP admin&lt;br&gt;• TCP 5000 — Flask demo&lt;br&gt;• TCP 3000 — Metabase&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Origem/CIDR não confirmada.&lt;br&gt;Validar regras reais no console AWS; prefira restringir por IP." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="300" width="285" x="350" y="220" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-ec2-frame" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#101B2D;strokeColor=#38BDF8;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fontColor=#BAE6FD;fontSize=20;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=18;spacingLeft=86;" value="AMBIENTE EC2 / UBUNTU — serviços observados no servidor" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="800" width="850" x="680" y="165" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-ec2-icon" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.ec2;" value="" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="58" width="58" x="695" y="176" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-flask" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#172554;strokeColor=#60A5FA;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#DBEAFE;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;FLASK • NovaMart&lt;/b&gt;  |  TCP 5000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Home: KPIs + pedidos recentes&lt;br&gt;• Clientes, vendedores, produtos&lt;br&gt;• Pedidos: lista, detalhe, cadastro&lt;br&gt;• Relatórios mensais → PDF&lt;br&gt;• Dashboard → iframe Metabase&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Acesso ao PostgreSQL via psycopg2&lt;br&gt;Sem autenticação identificada no app.py&lt;br&gt;DEBUG ligado (modo demo)" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="270" width="350" x="720" y="250" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-metabase" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#3B1D36;strokeColor=#FB7185;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFE4E6;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;METABASE&lt;/b&gt;  |  TCP 3000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Java service observado no host&lt;br&gt;Dashboard incorporado na rota /dashboard&lt;br&gt;Navegador carrega o iframe diretamente&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Token/URL de embed configurados à parte; não desenhados." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="205" width="385" x="1100" y="250" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-postgres" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#0F3D3E;strokeColor=#2DD4BF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#CCFBF1;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;POSTGRESQL • banco lógico&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Banco: novamart&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema app (origem):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;customers • sellers • products&lt;br&gt;orders • order_items • payments&lt;br&gt;reviews • coupons • seller_payouts&lt;br&gt;order_statuses • payment_methods&lt;br&gt;product/seller categories • subcategories&lt;br&gt;shipping_companies • platform_config&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Conexão parametrizada por .env / DB_HOST, DB_PORT (padrão 5432).&lt;br&gt;Localização física do banco não confirmada." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="460" width="300" x="1570" y="230" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-pipeline" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#422006;strokeColor=#FBBF24;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FEF3C7;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;ORQUESTRADOR • scripts/run_pipeline.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Executado pelo cron a cada 2 min ( */2 * * * * )&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. continuous_ingestion.py — gera pedidos e atualiza status/estoque/avaliações&lt;br&gt;2. dbt build sequencial: stg → int → marts; para na primeira falha&lt;br&gt;3. dbt docs generate se as etapas anteriores passarem&lt;br&gt;Falha/sucesso → alerta Discord (webhook opcional)&lt;br&gt;Logs: logs/cron.log + logs/pipeline_*.log" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="185" width="790" x="720" y="550" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2-stg" parent="gnLcNyWY0Evw4l4dNUEn-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#172554;strokeColor=#60A5FA;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#DBEAFE;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;STG • VIEWS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;schema: novamart_analytics_stg&lt;br&gt;fonte: app.* no PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;stg_customers • stg_sellers&lt;br&gt;stg_products • stg_orders&lt;br&gt;stg_order_items • stg_payments&lt;br&gt;stg_reviews • stg_order_statuses&lt;br&gt;stg_product_categories&lt;br&gt;stg_categorias_mkt" vertex="1">
